(1. Executive Summary and Architecture Overview) '
(The Transformer architecture replaces recurrent neural networks with multi-head self-attention mechanisms.) '
(This allows computing scaled dot-product attention across all input tokens simultaneously in parallel.) '
(Dense vector representations capture semantic nuances in high-dimensional continuous space.) '
(ALiBi and Rotary Positional Embeddings provide strong length extrapolation for large context windows.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
