(2. Computational Complexity and Attention Variations) '
(Standard multi-head self-attention exhibits O\(N^2\) computational time and memory complexity.) '
(When sequence length N scales to 32k tokens, linear attention approximations and FlashAttention become essential.) '
(Cross-encoders are utilized in downstream reranking stages to accurately score query-document relevance.) '
ET
endstream
